$texts_to_prompts — move texts into prompts

SUMMARY
  Copies content from each texts[] link into prompts[] (one file per text,
  or one joined file). Clears texts[] afterward. Bridges $llm / $list output
  into prompt-consuming externals like $image.

SYNTAX
  $texts_to_prompts
  $texts_to_prompts(join=1)

INPUT
  texts[] — source strings.

OUTPUT
  prompts[] — new links with the same text content.
  texts[] — cleared.

ARGUMENTS
  join=1 | true | yes — merge all texts into one prompts[] entry.

EXAMPLE
  @rand_prompt: $llm[3] -> $texts_to_prompts -> @good_quality_image

PROMPT-CONSUMING
  No (clears texts, not prompts).
